usage: greenmax-tablero-gen.py [-h] --gm GM [--out OUT] [--tab TAB] [--legend] [--stdout] src

Generate a redesigned GreenMAX tablero Px.

positional arguments:
  src         original tablero .px from the station backup

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --gm GM     control-folder tag, e.g. GM08 (plain number, no leading zero)
  --out OUT   output .md path (fenced Px). Omit with --stdout.
  --tab TAB   PxView/tablero display name for the doc header
  --legend    also add the read-only 'Horarios' legend
  --stdout    print the .md to stdout instead of a file
